  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Int.Freedom of Expression Exchange (IFEX) is a network of 88 free     expression organisations that aims to lead and facilitate the freedom of expression community worldwide to work together, increasing the    effectiveness of free expression advocacy work. IFEX mission is to    defend and promote freedom of expression and opinion worldwide,</narrative>
